In `const a = 1, { b } = obj`, debug mode highlights `const a`, then the destructuring pattern `{ b }` of the second declarator but not its value, which a pattern's outline line never prints.
== args
--debug
input/const-binding-pattern.ts
== file input/const-binding-pattern.ts
const a = 1, { b } = obj;
== stdout
«const a» = 1, «{ b }» = obj;
== stderr
== exit 0
